The suffering of the present in this vision is directed towards a spiritually liberated future.
Oscar Wilde wrote to Helena Sickert about conditions in American prisons in April 1882.

**********Formulated hard query**********

This position requires `a certain process`.
The suffering of the present in this vision is directed towards `a certain future state`.
Oscar Wilde wrote to `someone` about conditions in American prisons in April 1882.

**********Validation Result**********

subquestion 'This position requires `a certain process`.' is NOT supported by the context.
<reject> The text does not contain the phrase "a certain process" or any statement indicating that "this position" (or any position) requires such a process. The word "position" appears in the text, but it refers to "Ireland’s colonised position" or the "position of other Irish artists in exile," not a role or job that would require a process. </reject>

